{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this file to .clasp.json and fill in your own scriptId.",
    "The real .clasp.json is gitignored because the script ID is specific to",
    "your Google account.",
    "",
    "Find your scriptId in the Apps Script editor under Project Settings (gear",
    "icon) -> IDs -> Script ID.",
    "",
    "Optional — clasp lets you push code from this repo instead of pasting:",
    "  npm install -g @google/clasp",
    "  clasp login",
    "  clasp push",
    "",
    "Pasting into the editor works perfectly well too. clasp is a convenience,",
    "not a requirement."
  ],
  "scriptId": "PASTE_YOUR_SCRIPT_ID_HERE",
  "rootDir": "src"
}
